description	"Covert Ops Trooper

Republic Intelligence specialists designed for infiltration and false-flag operations.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Assemble (1)
- Sense Immunity
- Tracking Beacon
- Knockdown Roll
- Grapple Hop
- Slow Faller
- 15% faster hacking

^3Abilities:
- Quickthrow (3) ^3[CS2]"